  <section id="faq" class="sec bg-slate-50" data-section="faq">
  <div class="container-narrow">
  {{ sectionHeader('FAQ', 'GaN Charger <span class="text-brandOrange">FAQ</span>', 'Essential for OEM/ODM partnerships', {max: ''}) }}
  <div class="reveal">
  {% call faqItem("What is the MOQ for OEM GaN charger orders?", true) %}Our MOQ is <strong>{FACT:moq.stock} units</strong> per SKU for standard GaN V models. Custom ODM projects with unique housing or multi-port configurations require {FACT:moq.dev} units. All GaN chargers benefit from our automated production lines, ensuring consistent quality across high-volume orders.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("What fast charging protocols are supported?", true) %}Our GaN chargers support <strong>PD 3.1 (up to 140W), PPS, QC 5.0, SCP, and AFC</strong>. Universal compatibility from iPhone 15 to MacBook Pro 16 and Samsung Galaxy devices.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("Are GaN chargers safe?", true) %}Yes. GaN chargers generate <strong>less heat than silicon chargers</strong>, reducing fire risks. They include advanced over-voltage/current protection and thermal monitoring.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("What power options are available?") %}<strong>20W-240W</strong> range. Popular: 20W-30W (phone), 45W-65W (laptop), 100W-140W (high-performance). All use latest GaN V technology.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("Can you customize the design?") %}Yes. Our OEM/ODM service includes <strong>custom CMF, logo printing, packaging design, and port configuration</strong>. GaN-specific options include foldable AC pins, retractable cables, integrated power strip designs, and multi-port desktop stations with GaN V technology.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("What efficiency advantages does GaN V offer?") %}GaN V technology delivers <strong>92-95% power efficiency</strong> compared to 85-88% for traditional silicon chargers (Navitas/EPC GaN transistor performance benchmarks). This means 40% smaller size, 30% less heat generation, and compliance with DOE Level VI / EU ErP efficiency standards. Ideal for brands targeting premium market segments.{% endcall %}
  </div>
 </div>
